@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护持续治疗方</u>\n<u>案及确认控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:治疗方案</u>" as Plan
participant "<u>:方案版本</u>" as PlanVersion
participant "<u>:方案项目</u>" as PlanItem
participant "<u>:患者决定</u>" as Decision
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-22办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-22办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Plan : 提出方案草稿(患者、诊断来源及目标)
activate Plan
Plan -> PlanVersion : 形成待确认版本(预计安排及变更原因)
activate PlanVersion
PlanVersion -> PlanItem : 组织计划明细(牙位牙面、数量、估算)
activate PlanItem
PlanItem --> PlanVersion : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PlanItem
PlanVersion --> Plan : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PlanVersion
Plan -> PlanVersion : 提交方案说明(已核对项目及预计安排)
activate PlanVersion
PlanVersion --> Plan : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PlanVersion
Plan --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Plan
K -> Plan : 确认患者决定(具体版本、范围、文书依据)
activate Plan
Plan -> PlanVersion : 登记确认经历(同意、暂缓或拒绝)
activate PlanVersion
PlanVersion -> Decision : 保留患者决定(时间、代理依据和范围)
activate Decision
Decision --> PlanVersion : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Decision
PlanVersion --> Plan : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PlanVersion
Plan --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Plan
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Decision
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
